cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite both the article and the Zenodo dataset."
title: "Analysis code: EEG headset comparison in multi-user collaborative VR"
abstract: >-
  Analysis and reproducibility code for a within-participant comparison of a
  four-channel and a single-channel consumer EEG headset during collaborative
  learning tasks in multi-user virtual reality, evaluated with CNN, LSTM and
  CNN-LSTM architectures under cross-subject, within-subject and eye-state
  control paradigms.
type: software
